      "headline_hint": "Mass protests and clashes erupt across France and wider Europe over cost of living",
      "section": "world",
      "batch_position": 0,
      "claim_count": 14,
      "distinct_outlets": 3,
      "source_kinds": {
        "fulltext": 14
      },
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Nearly 1,000 arrests were made across France as hundreds of thousands protested on Saturday, according to French officials.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c95ynd587ynzo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The French interior ministry estimated that 410,000 people protested on Saturday, while trade unions reported about 800,000 participants.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c95ynd587ynzo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "French authorities deployed 70,000 police officers across several cities to manage protests over the cost of living and school conditions.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c95ynd587ynzo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "French President Emmanuel Macron decreed that only demonstrations organised by recognised trade unions would be permitted.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c95ynd587ynzo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "French Interior Minister Laurent Nuñez stated that two people were seriously injured during Saturday's protests, in Toulouse and Clermont-Ferrand.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c95ynd587ynzo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Riot police in Tirana, Albania, fired tear gas to disperse thousands of anti-government demonstrators on Saturday.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c95ynd587ynzo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Around 550,000 people participated in demonstrations across France the previous weekend, resulting in more than 2,500 arrests.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c95ynd587ynzo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "French authorities imposed partial curfews in certain urban zones of Paris and other cities.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "France 24",
          "url": "https://www.france24.com/en/france/20261024-the-marches-went-well-%E2%80%93-french-government-on-demonstrations-a-week-after-looting-and-violence",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Major Paris museums, including the Louvre and the Musée d'Orsay, closed on Saturday ahead of scheduled protests.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "France 24",
          "url": "https://www.france24.com/en/france/20261024-the-marches-went-well-%E2%80%93-french-government-on-demonstrations-a-week-after-looting-and-violence",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The main Paris protest march drew between 110,000 and 250,000 attendees according to authority and trade union estimates.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "France 24",
          "url": "https://www.france24.com/en/france/20261024-the-marches-went-well-%E2%80%93-french-government-on-demonstrations-a-week-after-looting-and-violence",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Interior Minister Laurent Nuñez reported a 20-year-old man had his fingers blown off in Toulouse during the protests.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "France 24",
          "url": "https://www.france24.com/en/france/20261024-the-marches-went-well-%E2%80%93-french-government-on-demonstrations-a-week-after-looting-and-violence",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Italian police arrested nine people and briefly detained 371 others across eight cities during protests on Saturday.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Channel News Asia",
          "url": "https://www.channelnewsasia.com/world/thousands-protest-in-italy-under-heavy-security-6489781",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Italian police stated that 110 of the people arrested or detained during protests in Italy were minors.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Channel News Asia",
          "url": "https://www.channelnewsasia.com/world/thousands-protest-in-italy-under-heavy-security-6489781",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The Italian government deployed 500 soldiers to Milan following looting during protests the previous weekend.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Channel News Asia",
          "url": "https://www.channelnewsasia.com/world/thousands-protest-in-italy-under-heavy-security-6489781",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        }
      ]
    },
